cmu-sas-description = You are part of Special Air Service - Tier One special forces of the TWE. You have been called by TWE Ambassador, report in and protect the Ambassador.

cmu-sas-greeting = You are a member of Special Air Service regiment.
             You have been called by TWE Ambassador on the colony.
             Report in ASAP, make contact with the Ambassador and protect them.

             'We going deep, and we going hard.

             Surely you can't be serious.

             I am serious, and don't call me Shirley.'

cmu-sas-rules = You report to the nearest highest authority, either TWE Ambassador or your SAS Commander. Protect the Ambassador at all cost.

cmu-sas-assault-description = You are part of a Special Air Service assault squad, deployed to support the operation at the request of the forces on the ground.
cmu-sas-assault-greeting = Your SAS assault squad has been called in to support the operation. Contact the requesting force, coordinate with its command, and follow your SAS Commander's orders.
cmu-sas-assault-rules = You are allied to the TWE and its allies. Support the requesting force's operation under your SAS Commander's leadership.
cmu-sas-assault-supervisors = the requesting force's Commanding Officer
